WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.460
- Would you consider doing
a Gilmore Girls musical?

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:04.706
Just asking for a friend.

00:00:04.706 --> 00:00:05.539
- Hmm...

00:00:05.539 --> 00:00:08.030
(applause)

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:10.329
I just wanna see Luke dancing.

00:00:10.329 --> 00:00:11.162
- Oh my God.

00:00:11.162 --> 00:00:14.740
I, so I guess it was a
running joke on the show

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:18.080
Morning Show where they
assign one of the reporters

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.270
to cover Gilmore Girls: The Musical

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:21.050
and the person is like rolling their eyes

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:23.410
because, you know, it seems silly

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.230
but then there's discussion
that no, it's a beloved show.

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:30.810
I mean, I always felt that
language and that kind of pace

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:33.469
and the way the tone of the
show is very theatrical--

00:00:33.469 --> 00:00:35.090
- That's what I was gonna
say, it's very Broadway.

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:36.069
- It is.

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:36.902
- It's constant.

00:00:36.902 --> 00:00:38.290
- I mean you have to
take a deep long breath

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:39.967
before you deliver some of those lines--

00:00:39.967 --> 00:00:40.800
- Oh those monologues!

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:41.633
- They go on and on forever.

00:00:41.633 --> 00:00:43.810
So I think it's kind of a good idea.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.760
- I think people would love it.

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:48.090
- I think, I mean she
loves dance and there's

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:49.630
so much dance always in the show,

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:53.930
so, but again as I told
you if you ask me to sing,

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:54.926
I'll just show up.

00:00:54.926 --> 00:00:55.759
(laughing)

00:00:55.759 --> 00:00:56.626
So it doesn't really,

00:00:56.626 --> 00:00:59.170
we can you know actually
put it on Broadway

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:00.850
or in your garage, it doesn't matter.

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:01.683
I'll do it.

00:01:01.683 --> 00:01:02.580
You know what, I love that about you.

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.237
You're like I can be fancy and low key.

00:01:04.237 --> 00:01:05.070
- That's right.

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:06.300
- I love that.

